# Simplified Chinese for the menus and the controller labels of VR Video Player (docs/i18n.md).
#
# MACHINE DRAFT: written by a language model, not yet checked by a native reader. Corrections are welcome. The
# entries are not marked fuzzy on purpose: Godot's loader skips fuzzy entries, and the draft is better than English.
#
# Glossary (keep these the same everywhere):
#   Source (the rail) 片源 · film 影片 · video 视频 · file 文件 · folder 文件夹 · Library 片库
#   Picture 画面 · Sound 声音 · Subtitles 字幕 · Room 房间 · Objects 物品 · Mixed reality 混合现实 · System 系统
#   play 播放 · pause 暂停 · next / previous 下一个 / 上一个 · Undo 撤销 · Cancel 取消 · Reset 重置
#   headset 头显 · controller 手柄 · trigger 扳机 · grip 握把 · stick 摇杆 · bumper 肩键 · menu (button) 菜单
#   panel 面板 · screen 屏幕 · seat 座位 · assistant 助手 · pair 配对 · host 主机 · share 共享
#   the headset's cameras 摄像头 · area 区域 · layer 图层 · foveation 注视点渲染 · 3D, HDR, PC: as they are
#   Units: s 秒, min 分钟, px 像素; "%%" stays; full-width ，：（） in Chinese text, ASCII around numbers.
#
# Make it again from messages.pot with tools/i18n.py merge app/locale/zh_CN.po; check with tools/i18n.py check.
