msgid "Off: the film is drawn in the room."
msgstr "关：影片在房间中绘制。"

msgid "This engine has no OpenXR layers."
msgstr "此引擎没有 OpenXR 图层。"

msgid "Only in the headset: here the film is drawn in the room."
msgstr "仅在头显中可用：这里影片在房间中绘制。"

msgid "180, 360 and fisheye films are drawn in the room."
msgstr "180°、360° 和鱼眼影片在房间中绘制。"

msgid "A curved screen is drawn in the room (curved layers are off)."
msgstr "曲面屏幕在房间中绘制（曲面图层已关闭）。"

msgid "This headset has no curved layers: a curved screen is drawn in the room."
msgstr "此头显没有曲面图层：曲面屏幕在房间中绘制。"

msgid "On; nothing to show."
msgstr "开；没有可显示的内容。"

msgid "On; the room draws the film while the menu is open, so the menu shows in front."
msgstr "开；菜单打开时由房间绘制影片，菜单因此显示在前面。"

msgid "On; the room draws the film while something is in front of the screen, so it shows."
msgstr "已开启；屏幕前有东西时由房间绘制影片，它才能显示在前面。"

msgid "In use: two cylinder layers, one per eye, %d x %d px each."
msgstr "使用中：两个圆柱图层，每只眼睛一个，各 %d x %d 像素。"

msgid "In use: two quad layers, one per eye, %d x %d px each."
msgstr "使用中：两个平面图层，每只眼睛一个，各 %d x %d 像素。"

msgid "In use: one cylinder layer, %d x %d px."
msgstr "使用中：一个圆柱图层，%d x %d 像素。"

msgid "In use: one quad layer, %d x %d px."
msgstr "使用中：一个平面图层，%d x %d 像素。"

