msgid "Assistant"
msgstr "助手"

msgid "An AI assistant on a computer on this network sees what plays, answers you on a card, and hears you while you hold the bumper. No program to install."
msgstr "本网络中一台电脑上的 AI 助手能看到正在播放的内容，在卡片上回答你，并在你按住肩键时听你说话。无需安装程序。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Read this code out to the assistant. Cancel if you did not ask for it."
msgstr "把这个代码读给助手听。如果不是你发起的请求，请取消。"

msgid "Let an assistant find me"
msgstr "让助手找到我"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Give the assistant this address. For an hour it can ask to pair; then it shows a code here for you to read out."
msgstr "把这个地址告诉助手。一小时内它可以请求配对；之后这里会显示一个代码，由你读出。"

msgid "Voice goes to"
msgstr "语音发送到"

msgid "Dev link"
msgstr "开发连接"

msgid "%s on this headset"
msgstr "此头显上的 %s"

msgid "%s, paired %s"
msgstr "%s，配对于 %s"

msgid "Forget"
msgstr "忘记"

msgid "%s asks to pair with this headset."
msgstr "%s 请求与此头显配对。"

msgid "%d min left  ·  pin %s"
msgstr "剩余 %d 分钟  ·  PIN %s"

msgid "Off: it can see what plays and answer on the card, nothing else."
msgstr "关：它只能看到正在播放的内容并在卡片上回答，别的都不能做。"

msgid "Each change shows at once and is kept as a room in the Room tab. Ask the assistant to change it back, or Reset room for the stock room."
msgstr "每次更改都会立即显示，并作为一个房间保存在“房间”页中。可以让助手改回来，或用“重置房间”恢复原装房间。"

msgid "Picture, sound, subtitles and system preferences, kept as if you set them."
msgstr "画面、声音、字幕和系统偏好，保存得就像你自己设置的一样。"

msgid "Copies and downloads into the Library, places and saved hosts. It never sees a share's login."
msgstr "复制和下载到片库、位置和已保存的主机。它永远看不到共享的登录信息。"

msgid "Starts, stops, shows and hides Android apps and the agents on this headset."
msgstr "启动、停止、显示和隐藏此头显上的安卓应用和代理。"

msgid "Add host"
msgstr "添加主机"

msgid "Edit hosts"
msgstr "编辑主机"

msgid "Favourite"
msgstr "收藏"

msgid "In corner"
msgstr "放到角落"

msgid "Shuffle"
msgstr "随机播放"

msgid "Repeat: off"
msgstr "重复：关"

msgid "Play on"
msgstr "继续播放"

msgid "Gapless"
msgstr "无缝播放"

msgid "Clear upcoming"
msgstr "清空待播"

